### listing all tasks

GET http://127.0.0.1:8000/tasks/?project=e786f754-1c3f-4174-a86f-7cfc820a10a8

###create task
POST http://127.0.0.1:8000/tasks/
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "assigned_project":1,
    "assigned_to":21,
    "title":"environment setup",
    "description":"set environment and collect all credentials",
    "priority":"Medium"

}


### retrieve a task
GET http://127.0.0.1:8000/tasks/e972e4a8-ead8-4ec5-8148-9b9040bf6b5b/



### update a task
PATCH http://127.0.0.1:8000/tasks/e972e4a8-ead8-4ec5-8148-9b9040bf6b5b/
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "priority":"High"
}



### delete a task
DELETE  http://127.0.0.1:8000/tasks/e972e4a8-ead8-4ec5-8148-9b9040bf6b5b/


### generate tasks using gemini ai
POST http://127.0.0.1:8000/create-tasks-ai/e786f754-1c3f-4174-a86f-7cfc820a10a8/



### with Pagination
GET http://127.0.0.1:8000/tasks/?page=1&project=e786f754-1c3f-4174-a86f-7cfc820a10a8